HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The sswwii__aadddd() and sswwii__sscchheedd() functions first appeared in FreeBSD 5.0.
     They replaced the rreeggiisstteerr__sswwii() function which appeared in FreeBSD 3.0
     and the sseettssoofftt**(), and sscchheeddssoofftt**() functions which date back to at
     least 4.4BSD.  The sswwii__rreemmoovvee() function first appeared in FreeBSD 6.1.

